est \u79fb\u884c\uff09", "content_html": "DIP=SIP PTF \u691c\u8a3c\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u5236\u9650\u4e8b\u9805\u30fb\u5e72\u6e09\u3059\u308b\u6a5f\u80fd\u30fb\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u3001\u304a\u3088\u3073 ansible/ptftests \u304b\u3089 sonic-mgmt/tests/ipfwd/test_dip_sip.py (pytest) \u3078\u306e\u79fb\u884c\u306b\u4f34\u3046 HLD-\u5b9f\u88c5\u4e56\u96e2\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T04:12:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/dash/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/dash/", "title": "DASH \u95a2\u9023", "content_html": "DASH \u95a2\u9023 \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30c6\u30b4\u30ea\u306f\u3001area \u306e\u58c1\u3092\u8d8a\u3048\u3066 DASH \u306b\u95a2\u308f\u308b SONiC \u5074\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u6a2a\u65ad\u3067\u898b\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/dash.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:47:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/developer/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/developer/", "title": "\u958b\u767a\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "\u958b\u767a\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9 \u2014 SONiC \u306b\u6a5f\u80fd\u8ffd\u52a0\u30fb\u62e1\u5f35\u3092\u5165\u308c\u305f\u3044\u8aad\u8005\u3092\u60f3\u5b9a\u3057\u3001HLD\u30fbYANG\u30fbCONFIG_DB\u30fbCLI\u30fbdaemon / orch\u30fb\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u8a08\u753b\u306e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u95a2\u4fc2\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3057\u3001\u65b0\u6a5f\u80fd\u8ffd\u52a0\u6642\u306b\u89e6\u308b\u5c64\u3092\u9806\u306b\u4e26\u3079\u305f\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/developer.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/default-credential-management-for-california-sb-327-conformance/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/default-credential-management-for-california-sb-327-conformance/", "title": "\u65e2\u5b9a\u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u521d\u56de\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u5f37\u5236\u5909\u66f4\uff08California SB-327 \u6e96\u62e0\uff09", "content_html": "California SB-327 \u6e96\u62e0\u306e\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9\u6642\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\u65e2\u5b9a\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u306e\u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u671f\u9650\u5207\u308c\u5316\u3057\u3001\u521d\u56de SSH \u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u6642\u306b\u5f37\u5236\u5909\u66f4\u3055\u305b\u308b\u6a5f\u80fd\u3002HLD \u306f `/etc/rc.local` + `chage -d 0` \u3092\u63d0\u6848\u3059\u308b\u304c\u3001master \u5b9f\u88c5\u306f `build_debian.sh` \u5185\u306e `passwd -e` \u3067\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u3059\u308b evolved \u5f62\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/default-credential-management-for-california-sb-327-conformance.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T16:24:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/sfp-eeprom-parsing-gaps/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/sfp-eeprom-parsing-gaps/", "title": "SfpUtilBase \u306e EEPROM \u89e3\u6790\u6b20\u640d", "content_html": "SfpUtilBase\uff08sonic-platform-common, legacy sonic_sfp \u30d1\u30c3\u30b1\u30fc\u30b8\uff09\u306b\u6b8b\u308b\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u5236\u5fa1\u7cfb\u62bd\u8c61\u30e1\u30bd\u30c3\u30c9\u3068\u3001xcvrd \u7d4c\u7531\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3078\u7d71\u5408\u3059\u3079\u304d\u3068\u3055\u308c\u305f\u8a2d\u8a08\u65b9\u91dd\u3092\u3001\u8a72\u5f53\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u30fb\u95a2\u6570\u3092\u5f15\u7528\u3057\u3066\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/sfp-eeprom-parsing-gaps.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-13T05:32:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["api", "eeprom", "platform-common", "sfp", "xcvrd"]}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-buffer/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-buffer/", "title": "config buffer \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "config buffer \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 config buffer \u306f dynamic buffer \u304c\u6709\u52b9\u306a\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u3067\u3001CONFIG_DB \u306e BUFFER_PROFILE \u3092\u8ffd\u52a0\u30fb\u66f4\u65b0\u30fb\u524a\u9664\u3057\u3001shared headroom pool \u306e\u6bd4\u7387/\u30b5\u30a4\u30ba\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3059\u308b CLI \u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-buffer.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:48:29+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6/", "title": "DHCP_SERVER_IPV6 \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "DHCP_SERVER_IPV6 \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 \u7d44\u307f\u8fbc\u307f DHCPv6 \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u30022026-05 \u6642\u70b9\u3067 SONiC master \u306b\u306f\u672a\u5b9f\u88c5\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u73fe\u72b6\u306f DHCPv6 \u30ea\u30ec\u30fc (DHCP_RELAY) \u306e\u307f\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b\u70b9\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u53c2\u7167\u7528\u30b9\u30bf\u30d6\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-14T13:41:53+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/snmp-polling-timeout/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/snmp-polling-timeout/", "title": "SNMP polling \u304c timeout \u3059\u308b", "content_html": "Runbook: SNMP polling \u304c timeout \u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u3068\u5bfe\u51e6 (sonic_ax_impl \u306e hang\u3001ACL/community \u30df\u30b9\u3001bulk walk \u3078\u306e\u5207\u66ff\u3092\u6271\u3046)", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/snmp-polling-timeout.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:51:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "title": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09", "content_html": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09 \u2014 verification: discrepancy-found \u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u305f\u5168\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092 monitor subtype \u5225\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3057\u305f\u4e00\u89a7\u3002meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py \u3067\u751f\u6210\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:19:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/path-tracing-midpoint/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/path-tracing-midpoint/", "title": "Path Tracing Midpoint\uff08IPv6 HbH-PT \u306b MCD \u3092\u8ffd\u8a18\uff09", "content_html": "Path Tracing Midpoint \u306e SONiC \u5b9f\u88c5\u3092\u6271\u3046 HLD\u3002CLI / CONFIG_DB / SAI \u62e1\u5f35 / Capability \u53d6\u308a\u6271\u3044\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u88cf\u53d6\u308a\u3067\u6574\u7406", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/path-tracing-midpoint.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T00:46:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/macsec-sonic-high-level-design-document/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/macsec-sonic-high-level-design-document/", "title": "MACsec on SONiC\uff08wpa_supplicant + MACsec Mgr/Orch + SAI\uff09", "content_html": "MACsec on SONiC\uff08wpa_supplicant + MACsec Mgr/Orch + SAI\uff09 \u2014 IEEE 802.1AE / 802.1X-2010 \u6e96\u62e0\u306e Layer 2 \u6697\u53f7\u5316 \u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3059\u308b\u8a2d\u8a08\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/macsec-sonic-high-level-design-document.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/warmboot-known-issues-and-troubleshooting/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/warmboot-known-issues-and-troubleshooting/", "title": "\u30a6\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u65e2\u77e5\u554f\u984c\u3068\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "\u30a6\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u30fb\u9ad8\u901f\u30ea\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u65e2\u77e5\u554f\u984c\u3001syncd/SAI \u3068\u306e\u76f8\u4e92\u4f5c\u7528\u3001LAG \u30d5\u30e9\u30c3\u30d7\u3001SSH \u30bb\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u5207\u65ad\u554f\u984c\u306a\u3069 sonic-buildimage issue tracker \u304b\u3089\u53ce\u96c6\u3057\u305f\u5b9f\u88c5\u4e0a\u306e\u6ce8\u610f\u70b9\u3002\n", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/warmboot-known-issues-and-troubleshooting.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-13T06:17:15+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/11-reboot/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/11-reboot/", "title": "Reboot / Upgrade / Lifecycle", "content_html": "Reboot / Upgrade / Lifecycle \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e reboot family \u3068 upgrade lifecycle \u3092\u300c\u3069\u308c\u3092\u9078\u3076\u304b\u300d\u300c\u4f55\u304c\u4fdd\u6301\u3055\u308c\u308b\u304b\u300d\u300c\u904b\u7528\u6642\u306b\u3069\u3053\u3092\u898b\u308b\u304b\u300d\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u3080\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/11-reboot/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:43:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/11-reboot/advanced/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/11-reboot/advanced/", "title": "Reboot / Upgrade \u306e\u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af", "content_html": "Reboot / Upgrade \u306e\u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af \u2014 warm / fast / cold reboot \u306e\u57fa\u672c\u30d1\u30b9\u3092\u62bc\u3055\u3048\u305f\u5f8c\u306f\u3001\u53ce\u675f\u6642\u9593\u3092\u7e2e\u3081\u308b express reboot\u3001multi-ASIC / chassis \u7d1a\u306e\u540c\u671f\u3001in-service upgrade \u3068\u306e\u7d44\u5408\u305b\u304c\u8ad6\u70b9\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002express reboot \u306f\u73fe\u72b6 Cisco 8000 \u7cfb ASIC \uff08\u52a0\u3048\u3066 marvell-teralynx\uff09\u306b\u9650\u5b9a\u3055\u308c\u308b\u70b9\u304c\u6700\u91cd\u8981\u306e\u524d\u63d0\u3068\u306a\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/11-reboot/advanced.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T12:02:13+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:38:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/bgp-evpn/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/bgp-evpn/", "title": "BGP / EVPN \u95a2\u9023", "content_html": "BGP / EVPN \u95a2\u9023 \u2014 SONiC \u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u306f FRRouting (FRR) \u3092\u4e2d\u5fc3\u306b\u69cb\u7bc9\u3055\u308c\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u305d\u306e\u5927\u90e8\u5206\u304c BGP / EVPN-VXLAN / VNET \u306e\u904b\u7528\u306b\u95a2\u308f\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/bgp-evpn.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:47:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}